'''Robgoblins''' are a [[Races|race]] of goblin-like creatures. They are small creatures that live primarily in camps with other robgoblins. They have an affinity for destruction, explosives, magic and stealing.

Many robgoblins are [[:Category:Enemies|enemies]], but there are also robgoblin [[Non-Playable-Character|NPCs]] and questgivers.

==Sub-Races==
There are currently two sub-races of robgoblins in two [[Locations|locations]]. All of them have the basic body shape, skins, ears, and eyes, but there is a difference.

Robgoblins can be found in [[Sacred Grove]]. They have green skins, long ears, and big noses. They can also be found in [[Sunstone Valley]], although there are several differences in these two cousins. Such include a red skin tone and a default occupation as a scrapsmith. There is a [[Whirly's Scrap Camp|scrapsmith camp]] just outside of the hostile area controlled by these small creatures.

